From: cargo-extracted-bot <cargo-extracted-bot@protonmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 17:59:22 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] Move the resolver into crates/cargo-resolver

`src/resolver` with the types it operates on from `src/workspace` and the
pieces of `src/util` it cannot be separated from, moved as they are to the
same paths under `crates/cargo-resolver/src/`, so `crate::` and `super::`
paths inside them resolve once the crate root declares the same module
tree. `src/workspace/features.rs` comes along because `Dependency::serialized`
takes `CliUnstable` and `Features`, and the feature table depends on
`ResolveBehavior`.

The crate manifest, `lib.rs` and the `mod.rs` files declare that tree and
re-export what Cargo's `util/mod.rs` and `workspace/mod.rs` re-export. The
modules they name that are not moved files arrive in the following patches.
